Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["Tangent Spaces and Forms", "GuideTitle",
 CellID->942062912,ExpressionUUID->"a3a3c038-ca24-47b7-9945-83f1c1312fe3"],

Cell["\<\
The first-order structure of a substrate: the tangent space at a vertex, the \
displacements that move its vertices, the differential forms and cochains, \
and the tautological 1-form. A displacement of scale r sends each vertex to a \
set of vertices within distance r, a discrete flow for time r, and it is \
multivalued by design. Its operations are metric: scaling moves along the \
geodesics from each vertex to its images, the sum is the bisector of the two \
orders of composition, and the commutator is the loop of the two \
displacements and their inverses, or of their metric negatives. A form is a \
germ of values at a vertex on tuples of its neighbours, a cochain a value on \
the cliques of the graph; the restriction and integration maps pass between \
the two, and the coboundary, the differential, the wedge and the cup products \
act on them. The tangent space and the tautological 1-form still wait: both \
exist in the InfraGaugeTheory paclet and are to be copied here.\
\>", "GuideAbstract",
 CellID->2001916300,ExpressionUUID->"ef0ab37b-2e0d-4399-8f7e-82603ccbe925"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["", "GuideFunctionsSection",
 CellID->1866139230,ExpressionUUID->"a0ea3657-4c83-4862-93c8-ecf80cebc774"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Tangent spaces", "GuideFunctionsSubsection",ExpressionUUID->"6cddb4a8-834f-43ad-827d-14d1adac59c1"],

Cell["\<\
waits: the tangent space at a vertex, copied from InfraGaugeTheory, where it \
is GraphTangentBundle and TangentFiberedGraph\
\>", "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"dd1bfd88-3d84-4f59-81f3-b9749be46d65"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Displacements", "GuideFunctionsSubsection",ExpressionUUID->"a8320543-c86e-4b98-a625-84f1030e43a3"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["DisplacementCompose",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] composes displacements as flows, the leftmost acting first"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"73d497e3-c077-40bd-9b6f-30979fb41912"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["DisplacementScale",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] scales a displacement by t along the geodesics from each \
vertex to its images; t < 0 reflects through the base point"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"d1e30927-1673-4981-b5e1-500fe752d5af"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["DisplacementNegative",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the metric negative of a displacement, each step reflected \
through its base point"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"15efee7f-6a5a-4ff0-8a5a-29fb6c836335"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["DisplacementInverse",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the reversed relation, the inverse when the displacement is \
bijective"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"8d94c5ca-4335-4663-b322-1a0e8cbf629c"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["DisplacementSum",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the bisector of the two orders of composition of two \
displacements"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"03c1da83-8c45-4c9c-8b5a-513b1b8a3d0c"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["DisplacementCommutator",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the commutator loop of two displacements, by their inverses or \
by their metric negatives"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"cb97bc06-bdc7-44b9-a5dc-a8c0936bb13d"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["DisplacementBracket",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the commutator by metric negatives, the scale-dependent bracket"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"d46f0a45-00ec-4cdd-bf42-23df5981d493"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["DisplacementMagnitude",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the largest step of a displacement, its scale"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"1648b9f5-4a19-4844-b92b-4d0e2190815f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["DisplacementReduce",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] contracts each value set of a displacement to its metric \
centre, iterated to a fixed point"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"5a5472f2-6599-4925-ae05-25cdf13ee3c5"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Kinds of displacements", "GuideFunctionsSubsection",ExpressionUUID->"3848dcf3-7a83-4600-ac16-d020924b30f7"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["DisplacementSingleValuedQ",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] whether every value of a displacement is a single vertex"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"18115246-120e-4a54-9177-c453f4b49ef0"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["DisplacementBijectionQ",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] whether a displacement is a single-valued permutation of the \
vertices"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"a4f22cad-b511-4674-ae22-a6891c398058"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["DisplacementIsomorphismQ",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] whether a displacement is a graph automorphism, a discrete \
Killing displacement"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"49877066-d77b-432b-84a5-99db495a9033"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["ContinuousDisplacementQ",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] whether a displacement is k-continuous, in the weak, Hausdorff \
or strong sense"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"695e1337-28d9-49ac-a120-f71cb52f1361"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["FindKillingDisplacement",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the nontrivial automorphism of least magnitude, as a \
displacement"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"7a9ac29c-23d0-484c-acf3-1fea27cc771c"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["KillingDisplacementMagnitude",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the least magnitude of a nonidentity automorphism, Infinity on \
an asymmetric graph"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"e889142e-6418-454b-a946-90492a80dd5c"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Canonical displacements", "GuideFunctionsSubsection",ExpressionUUID->"d9846c29-5e62-406c-a58a-10e0afe57c18"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["RandomDisplacement",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] a random continuous displacement of magnitude at most r"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"1db66116-94d5-4483-a516-a4e1949e05b1"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["PolarDisplacements",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the radial and the angular displacement about a centre"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"07a7ed6a-4ed1-4820-aff3-67d0ae1aacd1"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["GradientDisplacement",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the steepest-ascent displacement of a vertex function"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"d881f421-0f32-4fb4-9c1d-373cd81ce4d7"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["TranslationDisplacement",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the translation by a vector of the graph embedding, each \
vertex moved to the nearest vertices"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"ef8516d0-37a4-4b1a-9ee0-c89fcdcb64a7"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["DisplacementPlot",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] a displacement, or a sequence of them, drawn as bent arcs over \
the graph"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"dc953a33-0959-40ca-8102-fca93f63a424"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Forms and cochains", "GuideFunctionsSubsection",ExpressionUUID->"dc41c3ac-3874-4c54-890f-2b26c564e45d"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["FormValue",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the value of the germ of a form at a vertex on a tuple of its \
neighbours, alternating in the tuple"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"50c8f3ba-6cb7-42f5-8831-b80e3f436fe1"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["CochainValue",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the value of an alternating cochain on a vertex tuple"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"c50fbf40-e22c-47a8-826f-0e2b1a2e15fd"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["OrderedCochainValue",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the value of an ordered cochain on an increasing vertex tuple"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"4e43295c-24ea-46e6-bd3d-feeed7fa6929"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["FormDegree",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the degree of a form"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"247a3c52-9452-4cf4-9fb2-ee732ed32781"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["CochainDegree",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the degree of a cochain"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"0df07c4b-cee5-4d3c-99dd-daac111d318d"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["ZeroForm",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] a vertex function as a 0-form"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"ed580daf-0d6b-41c5-af7f-ab18958be0af"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["RestrictionMap",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the form read from an alternating cochain with the base vertex \
prepended"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"6b0b182a-d54e-4c58-9c40-938d68dbc68b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["IntegrationMap",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the cochain averaged from the germs of a form over each \
clique, a left inverse of RestrictionMap"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"6556bc0b-32e3-4113-b928-efb87d768f35"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Coboundary",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the coboundary of a cochain, the alternating sum over the \
faces of every clique one dimension up"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"81e97f9b-0c44-4ade-b563-05e86acd79d0"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["FormDifferential",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the differential of a form, the gradient on 0-forms and with a \
transport term on 1-forms"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"5118e409-795c-4c41-bab9-754f51958799"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["NaiveDifferential",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the differential of a 1-form with the transport term dropped, \
kept for comparison"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"a95f915b-8254-4d4e-8b4e-4cfb8af35c00"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["FormWedge",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the wedge product of forms, fibre by fibre"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"89333455-37c9-4c7e-b302-82e64879eaa7"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["CochainCup",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the cup product of alternating cochains, antisymmetrised over \
the orderings of each clique"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"660fdcb2-7d28-47c7-8ddf-faa901220c48"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["OrderedCochainCup",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the Alexander-Whitney cup product of ordered cochains"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"10c816d9-bcb6-4009-acb5-8b3a93043807"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["CochainCupOne",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the Steenrod cup-1 product of ordered cochains"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"7ae2035d-076e-483c-9d2a-f6044907e225"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["AntisymmetrizedCup",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] an alias of CochainCup"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"50c33b0b-cbd6-402f-8f59-55a62e7a7499"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["The tautological 1-form", "GuideFunctionsSubsection",ExpressionUUID->"6349700e-7bf2-42f8-90c1-185e4db4562c"],

Cell["\<\
waits: the cotangent space and the tautological 1-form, copied from \
InfraGaugeTheory, where they are GraphCotangentBundle, CotangentFlip, \
InfraTautologicalSection and InfraTautologicalOneForm, the last evaluated by \
InfraCanonicalOneForm\
\>", "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"9a91e817-f9d9-485d-843a-05182c79470c"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

